Issue title: [IndVarSimplify] samesign flag should be dropped after narrowing
Detailed information:
The transformation performed by this pass is incorrect: alive2 reports that the optimized IR does not refine the original IR.
Please modify the following code in llvm/lib/Transforms/Scalar/IndVarSimplify.cpp to fix the bug:
